        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WP026, 4\" Early American Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass, this 4\" Early American styled pull handle is great for windows, cabinets, drawers, furniture or small utility type doors. The Solid Brass 4 Inch Early American Cabinet Pull is surface mounted to the face of the door in the classic early american style. Includes matching finish screws for easy installation. Available in 10 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-WP026-size.gif?v=1704354669\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WP026 Early American Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-utility-pull-handle-deltana-wp27\"><b>6\" Early American Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana WP026 Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Height: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WP026.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WP026 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the cabinet handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>",
