                "title": "Solid Brass 4 Inch Early American Cabinet Pull | Deltana WP026",
                "description": "Deltana WP026 - Made of solid brass, this 4 Inch Early American styled pull handle is great for windows, cabinets, drawers, furniture or small utility type doors. The Solid Brass 4 Inch Early American Cabinet Pull is surface mounted to the face of the door in the classic early american style. Includes matching finish screws for easy installation. Available in 10 different finishes.",
